   "snippet": "We had a friend recommend this BBQ to us, and being as we favor Lockhart's BBQ, I will say this spot was a pleasant surprise. The best pork ribs were glistening, but the smoked turkey was some of the best ive had. The sweet corn casserole and tater tot casserole were too good not to finish on the spot. We got there around 11 on a sunday with no wait, and we noticed it got pretty busy around 1230. Come check this place out, you won't be disappointed!!",
